"text":"호스트는","x":1002,"y":689,"width":138,"height":35},{"text":"수많은","x":1153,"y":688,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"라우터와","x":1274,"y":690,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"다양한","x":1428,"y":692,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"형태의","x":1547,"y":692,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"링크를","x":1667,"y":692,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"통해","x":1781,"y":694,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"연","x":1856,"y":704,"width":24,"height":37}]},{"text":"결되어 지구상의 서로 다른 지역에 있을 수 있다. 애플리케이션 프로세스는 메시지 운","words":[{"text":"결되어","x":563,"y":746,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"지구상의","x":679,"y":747,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"서로","x":829,"y":748,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":910,"y":747,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"지역에","x":993,"y":748,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"있을","x":1111,"y":748,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1192,"y":750,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1244,"y":750,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":1336,"y":752,"width":208,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스는","x":1560,"y":753,"width":174,"height":36},{"text":"메시지","x":1748,"y":752,"width":91,"height":40},{"text":"운","x":1854,"y":762,"width":27,"height":38}]},{"text":"반에 사용되는 물리적인 하위 구조의 세부 사항에 상관없이 서로 메시지를 송신하기","words":[{"text":"반에","x":561,"y":807,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"사용되는","x":644,"y":807,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"물리적인","x":797,"y":808,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"하위","x":951,"y":808,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"구조의","x":1035,"y":808,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"세부","x":1155,"y":809,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"사항에","x":1241,"y":811,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"상관없이","x":1362,"y":812,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"서로","x":1521,"y":813,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"메시지를","x":1606,"y":812,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"송신하기","x":1760,"y":812,"width":117,"height":48}]},{"text":"위해서 트랜스포트 계층에서 제공하는 논리적 통신을 시용한다. 그림 3.1은 논리적 통","words":[{"text":"위해서","x":560,"y":867,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":674,"y":868,"width":172,"height":36},{"text":"계층에서","x":862,"y":868,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"제공하는","x":1012,"y":869,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"논리적","x":1164,"y":870,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"통신을","x":1282,"y":871,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"시용한다.","x":1402,"y":873,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"그림","x":1566,"y":873,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"3.1은","x":1649,"y":873,"width":84,"height":36},{"text":"논리적","x":1746,"y":872,"width":93,"height":40},{"text":"통","x":1853,"y":881,"width":27,"height":38}]},{"text":"신의 개념을 보여 준다.","words":[{"text":"신의","x":560,"y":928,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"개념을","x":640,"y":928,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"보여","x":753,"y":929,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"준다.","x":834,"y":929,"width":77,"height":38}]},{"text":"그림 3.1에서와 같이 트랜스포트 계층 프로토콜은 네트워크 라우터가 아닌 종단","words":[{"text":"그림","x":624,"y":989,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"3.1에서와","x":708,"y":989,"width":154,"height":39},{"text":"같이","x":878,"y":990,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":962,"y":990,"width":174,"height":37},{"text":"계층","x":1154,"y":991,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"프로토콜은","x":1240,"y":994,"width":175,"height":36},{"text":"네트워크","x":1433,"y":994,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"라우터가","x":1590,"y":993,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"아닌","x":1744,"y":994,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"종단","x":1824,"y":999,"width":56,"height":43}]},{"text":"시스템에서 구현된다. 송신 측의 트랜스포트 계층은 송신 애플리게이션 프로세스로부","words":[{"text":"시스템에서","x":558,"y":1049,"width":165,"height":39},{"text":"구현된다.","x":742,"y":1051,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"송신","x":904,"y":1051,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"측의","x":987,"y":1051,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1071,"y":1051,"width":175,"height":37},{"text":"계층은","x":1263,"y":1053,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"송신","x":1380,"y":1054,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"애플리게이션","x":1467,"y":1055,"width":206,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스로부","x":1690,"y":1055,"width":190,"height":46}]},{"text":"터 수신한 메시지를, 인터